  "Content": {
    "Html": "<p>Today is #GivingTuesday, kicking off the charitable season with a celebration of giving and philanthropy. We are continuing our tradition of offering a limited-edition calendar. This year’s calendar is titled <em>Healthy for Life: Evidence-Based Inspiration for a Healthy 2020</em>. Most of the quotes in the calendar come from my new book, <a href=\"https://NutritionFacts.org/book/how-not-to-diet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">How Not to Diet</a>. I hope that they will give you a bit of inspiration and motivation to know how much power you have over your health every time you sit down to a meal.</p>\n<p>The first 200 people to donate $100 or more <em><a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.z2systems.com/np/clients/nutritionfacts/donation.jsp?campaign=42&amp;&amp;test=true\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://nutritionfacts.z2systems.com/np/clients/nutritionfacts/donation.jsp?campaign=42&amp;&amp;test=true\"><strong>using this form</strong></a> </em>to keep my 501c3 nonprofit NutritionFacts.org alive and thriving will get a calendar in time for the new year. Don’t wait—we always run out within a day or two. UPDATE: Thank you so much for your support; all calendars have been claimed!</p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">How Not to Diet Out Next Week</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/20190404_NF_0126.jpg/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-61591 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/20190404_NF_0126-1024x1022.jpg\" alt=\"How not to diet\" width=\"201\" height=\"201\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/20190404_NF_0126-1024x1022.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/20190404_NF_0126-960x959.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/20190404_NF_0126-768x767.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/20190404_NF_0126-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/20190404_NF_0126-1200x1198.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/20190404_NF_0126-720x719.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/20190404_NF_0126-540x539.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/20190404_NF_0126.jpg 1920w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 201px) 100vw, 201px\"/></a>Speaking of the new book, it’s landing on shelves in just one week! If you want to get it before anyone else, be sure to <a href=\"https://NutritionFacts.org/book/how-not-to-diet/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">pre-order</a> your copy today. To see what kind of blood, sweat, and tears went into this book, check out the <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/trailer-for-how-not-to-diet-dr-gregers-guide-to-weight-loss/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">book trailer</a> that went up on NutritionFacts.org yesterday. </p>\n<p>I also give a sneak peek of the book in my brand-new presentation that just went live: Evidence-Based Weight Loss. Watch it <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/evidence-based-weight-loss-live-presentation/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">here</a>. It’s also available for download, and as part of a complete collection of all of my live presentations, over on <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads\">Dr.Greger.org </a>(all proceeds go straight to NutritionFacts.org).</p>\n<p>I’m excited to kick off my 2020 speaking tour in <a href=\"https://jccmanhattan.org/programs/special-event-dr-michael-greger-how-not-diet-evidence-based-weight-loss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://jccmanhattan.org/programs/special-event-dr-michael-greger-how-not-diet-evidence-based-weight-loss\">New York City</a> on December 15. Check out all of my upcoming speaking dates <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/pages/speaking-dates\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://drgreger.org/pages/speaking-dates\">here</a>.</p>\n<p> </p>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Back on London Real and TEDx</h4>\n<p>\n<a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/NAT09188-2.jpg/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-61593 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/NAT09188-2-1024x1024.jpg\" alt=\"London Real\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/NAT09188-2-1024x1024.jpg 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/NAT09188-2-960x960.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/NAT09188-2-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/NAT09188-2-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/NAT09188-2-1200x1200.jpg 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/NAT09188-2-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/NAT09188-2-540x540.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/NAT09188-2.jpg 2000w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>I was thrilled to be invited back into the London Real studio for another long-form interview with one of my favorite hosts, Brian Rose. You can watch that interview <a href=\"https://londonreal.tv/e/dr-michael-greger/?freshLRtvReg\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://londonreal.tv/e/dr-michael-greger/?freshLRtvReg\">here</a>. I was also honored to be back on a TEDx stage. Check out my new TEDx talk The Best Weight Loss Diet <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k8hgfXmZSHE&amp;feature=youtu.be\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=k8hgfXmZSHE&amp;feature=youtu.be\">here</a>.</p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Fasting Webinars Available in Bundle</h4>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/Fasting-Webinar-Bundle-Disc-Mockup.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"size-large wp-image-61599 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/Fasting-Webinar-Bundle-Disc-Mockup-1024x1024.png\" alt=\"Fasting-Webinar-Bundle\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/Fasting-Webinar-Bundle-Disc-Mockup-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/Fasting-Webinar-Bundle-Disc-Mockup-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/Fasting-Webinar-Bundle-Disc-Mockup-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/Fasting-Webinar-Bundle-Disc-Mockup-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/Fasting-Webinar-Bundle-Disc-Mockup-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/Fasting-Webinar-Bundle-Disc-Mockup-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/Fasting-Webinar-Bundle-Disc-Mockup-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/Fasting-Webinar-Bundle-Disc-Mockup.png 1728w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>I recently gave a series of webinars on fasting – Intermittent Fasting; Fasting for Disease Reversal; and Fasting and Cancer. They are all now available for download <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads/products/fasting-bundle-digital\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads/products/fasting-bundle-digital\">here</a>. We’ve bundled them together at a discounted price, but you can still get them separately <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\" data-cke-saved-href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads\">here</a>. Some of these videos are already up on <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/topics/fasting/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">NutritionFacts.org</a>, and the rest will be trickling out over the next couple of years. </p>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4> </h4>\n<h4 class=\"null\">Amazon Smile</h4>\n<p class=\"null\"><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/PrimeSmile.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\" wp-image-61595 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/PrimeSmile-1024x1023.png\" alt=\"Amazon Smile\" width=\"198\" height=\"198\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/PrimeSmile-1024x1023.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/PrimeSmile-960x959.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/PrimeSmile-768x767.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/PrimeSmile-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/PrimeSmile.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/PrimeSmile-720x719.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2019/12/PrimeSmile-540x540.png 540w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 198px) 100vw, 198px\"/></a>If you plan to do some holiday shopping on Amazon this year, you can support NutritionFacts.org at the same time by going to <a href=\"http://bit.ly/NFsmile\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\" data-is-link=\"http://bit.ly/NFsmile\" data-cke-saved-href=\"http://bit.ly/NFsmile\">http://bit.ly/NFsmile</a>. Android users can also support us through the Amazon shopping app. Simply follow these instructions to turn on AmazonSmile and start generating donations. These small donations add up; in the last year we have raised over $10,000<strong> </strong>through Amazon Smile. </p>\n<ol>\n<li data-extended-list=\"1\" data-indent=\"1\">Open the app on your Android device (update to the latest version, if necessary).</li>\n<li data-extended-list=\"1\" data-indent=\"1\">View Settings and select AmazonSmile.</li>\n<li data-extended-list=\"1\" data-indent=\"1\">Follow the in-app instructions to complete the process.</li>\n</ol>\n<p>(AmazonSmile is not currently available for iOS users.)</p>\n<div> </div>\n<div>In health,<br/>\n<b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b><p></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/subscribe/\"><b>here</b></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\"><u><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\"><u><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\"><u><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\"><u><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\"><u><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></u></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>"
